    backlog:areaMeasure "3 decks, 137 slides (53, 42, 42); deck standard 1.3.0 passes 13 of 13 on each; fit check refuses 2 slides (chapter 18 slide 43, chapter 19 slide 16); layout check clean; 64 code slides (27, 18, 19)" .
